        <https://example.org/skg-if/data/pending_org_%3A%3Ae85d8302463b72b005a941de763a5184> ;
    dcterms:title "Data from: Simplifying understory complexity in oil palm plantations is associated with a reduction in the density of a cleptoparasitic spider, Argyrodes miniaceus (Araneae: Theridiidae), in host (Araneae: Nephilinae) webs"@en ;
